    eq_greenhouse_n: 'Greenhouse "Hotbed"', eq_greenhouse_d: 'Boosters cost 25% less (lv 2: 50%).',
    eq_lantern_n: 'Lanterns "Fireflies"', eq_lantern_d: 'Move hint after 2 s (lv 2: after 1 s).',
    eq_fountain_n: 'Fountain "Patterns"', eq_fountain_d: 'Cascade coin bonus from ×4 (lv 2: +35 coins).',
    eq_scarecrow_n: 'Scarecrow "Grumbler"', eq_scarecrow_d: 'On defeat: +3 free moves once per level (lv 2: twice).',
    // ---- characters ----
    char_buto: 'Budkins the gnome', char_iskra: 'Spark the hummingbird', char_busya: 'Dot',
    char_vorchun: 'Grumbler the scarecrow', char_gold: 'The Golden gnome',
    // ---- story: "The Grey Blight and the seeds of light" ----
    st_pro_1: 'Oh, at last! I thought nobody would come. I am Budkins, keeper of grandpa\'s garden.',
    st_pro_2: 'The Grey Blight drank every color from the garden. Only the seeds of light remain — gems in the soil.',
    st_pro_3: 'Gather patterns of gems — and the colors will return! I am Spark, I will show the way.',
    st_pro_4: '…And care for the garden. As I once did.',
    st_c21_1: 'The beds are blooming again! And in grandpa\'s shed, look, there is real equipment — fix it and place it in the garden.',
    st_c21_2: 'Every repair lets the garden breathe easier. Check the "Garden" tab!',
    st_c41_1: 'The Blight thickens: logs and stones appeared on the beds. Smash them with bombs, gardener!',
    st_c41_2: 'C-creepy! But I am with you. Dot won\'t tell, Dot stays close.',
    st_c61_1: 'The neighbor orangery sent saplings: deliver them to the bottom bed — they will take root!',
    st_c61_2: 'Items sink when matches happen below them. Mind the bottom of the board!',
    st_c81_1: 'Ahem… Grumbler the scarecrow, in person. The Blight blew me off my post — I return with honor.',
    st_c81_2: 'Place me in the garden — and I will bail you out when moves run dry.',
    st_c101_1: 'Half the garden shines again! Look: patterns awakened by the fountain… grandpa would be glad.',
    st_c101_2: 'The golden gnome by the fountain is grandpa Yeremey — the Blight turned him to stone. We will break the spell!',
    st_c121_1: 'Aphids— err, darkness— ah! The Blight raises stone walls — the greenhouse and lanterns will help!',
    st_c121_2: 'Garden equipment grants power: moves, coins, discounts. Save coins — and fix!',
    st_c141_1: 'The Blight snaps back: more flowers, trickier patterns. Keep your nose to the wind!',
    st_c141_2: 'Special gems are your best friends now. Line up fives!',
    st_c161_1: 'In the heart of the Blight the boards get no refill: clear the beds completely!',
    st_c161_2: '…Soon. I feel the warmth. A few more patterns — and the stone will crack.',
    st_c181_1: 'The last frontier of the Blight! The garden holds its breath… and so do we.',
    st_c181_2: 'Gardener! All the garden\'s colors are in your hands. Forward!',
    st_b20_1: 'The first focus of the Blight is dispelled! Colors returned to the eastern beds.',
    st_b40_1: 'The bees are back to the hive! The garden hums with joy — literally!',
    st_b60_1: 'The Blight retreated from the west. I stood guard, honestly. I barely trembled.',
    st_b80_1: 'The orangery rejoices: the saplings took root! The whole garden smells of it!',
    st_b100_1: 'Halfway! The fountain rang with patterns… the stone by it grew warmer.',
    st_b120_1: 'The northern dews glitter again! The Blight shrinks by the day!',
    st_b140_1: 'East, west, north — ours! Only the heart of the Blight remains. It is angriest there.',
    st_b160_1: '…I hear you. Through the stone. Thank you, gardener.',
    st_b180_1: 'The second-to-last focus has fallen! The garden shines like in grandpa\'s best years!',
    st_b200_1: 'The stone… cracked. My grandchild! You returned the colors to the garden — and life to me.',
    st_b200_2: 'Yeremey\'s garden blooms again. And now it is your garden, gardener.',
    st_b200_3: 'Hooray! A feast for the whole garden! Petal confetti everywhere!',
    st_b200_4: 'Grandpa, look what our kid has done… Oh, beauty! Stay with us — there are still many beds!'
  }
};

